# Undying Flames (sandoria 26), each status operand alone (the GM sets the status, the other operands hold). Pagisalis
# at fame level 2: available 562, accepted 565 (not 562), completed 566. Two lumps of beeswax: available nothing,
# completed nothing, accepted 563. The finishes read no status: 562 finished after a GM completion while it is open
# (option 0: addQuest, the current bit; still completed); 563 finished after a GM delQuest while it is open (completed
# from available).
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=136.6,6.5,131.7 job=WAR lvl=30
item LumpOfBeeswax x4
fame Sandoria 50
login
trigger Pagisalis                         # available, fame level 2: 562
finish option=1                           # declined
quest Sandoria.UndyingFlames accepted
trigger Pagisalis                         # accepted, fame level 2: 565
finish
quest Sandoria.UndyingFlames completed
trigger Pagisalis                         # completed, fame level 2: 566
finish
trade Pagisalis LumpOfBeeswax x2          # completed: nothing
quest Sandoria.UndyingFlames available
trade Pagisalis LumpOfBeeswax x2          # available: nothing
trigger Pagisalis                         # 562
quest Sandoria.UndyingFlames completed
finish option=0                           # addQuest (the current bit); still completed
quest Sandoria.UndyingFlames available
quest Sandoria.UndyingFlames accepted
trade Pagisalis LumpOfBeeswax x2          # accepted: 563
quest Sandoria.UndyingFlames available
finish                                    # available while 563 is open: completed all the same (lumps taken, the rope)
